1
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:06,270
You don’t want it?

2
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:07,620
It’s very expensive.

3
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:10,270
No doubt. All you have is money.

4
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:11,720
Then why not accept it?

5
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:13,870
I'll throw it away.

6
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:16,980
Is it that cheap in your eyes?

7
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,840
Then throw it away.

8
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,570
You used the ring to embarrass me,

9
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:24,220
in front of that kind of girl.

10
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:28,430
I haven't broken up with Ji Hee.

11
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:31,930
Are you going to marry her, then?

12
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:35,410
Congratulations.

13
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:40,870
Is that you? Ji Hee, answer me.

14
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:46,690
Thank you for marrying me.

15
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,280
I love you.

16
00:00:52,090 --> 00:00:53,750
I love you.

17
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:58,120
I love you.

18
00:01:36,990 --> 00:01:40,150
- Yoo Jung, are you okay? - Yes.

19
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:43,430
What did we hit?

20
00:01:43,430 --> 00:01:45,230
I don't know.

21
00:01:46,780 --> 00:01:49,090
It's too dangerous. You stay here.

22
00:01:49,090 --> 00:01:50,050
Do Hoon.

23
00:01:50,050 --> 00:01:52,060
Listen to me. It's okay.

24
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,640
Do Hoon.

25
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,400
Do Hoon.

26
00:02:36,630 --> 00:02:38,020
Do Hoon.

27
00:02:39,230 --> 00:02:40,970
Do Hoon.

28
00:02:41,670 --> 00:02:42,980
Do Hoon.

29
00:02:43,710 --> 00:02:45,480
I told you to stay inside.

30
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:46,820
What was it?

31
00:02:54,410 --> 00:02:57,660
- Thank god. - Let's get out of here.

32
00:02:57,660 --> 00:02:59,430
Wait. Let's move it.

33
00:02:59,430 --> 00:03:01,420
Other cars might hit it.

34
00:03:33,730 --> 00:03:34,780
Are you her family member?

35
00:03:36,450 --> 00:03:39,290
Her viscera are bleeding due to the hit.

36
00:03:39,290 --> 00:03:40,840
Because she was left ignored for such a long time,

37
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:43,690
her liver and spleen have started hardening.

38
00:03:43,690 --> 00:03:48,260
The biggest problem is the dead infant

39
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:50,260
that keeps putting pressure on her uterus.

40
00:03:53,740 --> 00:03:55,790
She was pregnant?

41
00:03:55,790 --> 00:03:57,390
Yes, what we need to do now

42
00:03:57,390 --> 00:03:59,510
is to remove the fetus quickly.

43
00:03:59,910 --> 00:04:03,670
Please, save her.

44
00:04:06,590 --> 00:04:09,120
- Please. - I'll do my best.

45
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:11,770
Call Dr Park at once and get the O.R. ready.

46
00:04:14,670 --> 00:04:18,800
What happend?

47
00:04:28,870 --> 00:04:34,950
Kwang Soo. Find out exactly what happened.

48
00:05:57,320 --> 00:06:00,420
Knead the dough gently, or it won't rise well.

49
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:02,140
I know.

50
00:06:02,140 --> 00:06:03,760
That's not it. Step aside.

51
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,260
- Dad. - What?

52
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:07,130
I grew up playing with this.

53
00:06:07,130 --> 00:06:09,070
How can a baker's daughter don't know how to bake?

54
00:06:09,070 --> 00:06:12,210
The taste is more important than the shape.

55
00:06:12,210 --> 00:06:16,650
You have a long way to go. You need to learn a lot.

56
00:06:27,290 --> 00:06:32,400
So hot! Hot!

57
00:06:32,400 --> 00:06:34,430
They look good.

58
00:06:34,430 --> 00:06:38,140
Pay me first.

59
00:06:38,140 --> 00:06:41,210
Dad, if you treat me this way,

60
00:06:41,210 --> 00:06:43,500
you'll regret it after I get married.

61
00:06:58,020 --> 00:07:00,670
The family in 305 is showing off

62
00:07:00,670 --> 00:07:02,970
when the son opend a law firm.

63
00:07:02,970 --> 00:07:07,320
It costs a lot of money.

64
00:07:08,460 --> 00:07:10,050
Do Hoon, have a seat.

65
00:07:10,050 --> 00:07:12,830
It's your first day to work, you must eat your fill.

66
00:07:13,430 --> 00:07:18,260
Lawyers don't earn as much money as they used to do.

67
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:21,510
It's not easy to make money in the beginning.

68
00:07:21,510 --> 00:07:24,930
Stop talking about money in such an early morning.

69
00:07:24,930 --> 00:07:26,580
I'm not talking about money.

70
00:07:26,580 --> 00:07:29,160
You can't make so much money as a prosecutor.

71
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:31,790
The country won't pay you too much.

72
00:07:31,790 --> 00:07:34,010
I'm just proud that he finally make it

73
00:07:34,010 --> 00:07:37,560
after paying the high tuition.

74
00:07:41,430 --> 00:07:46,290
Son, a friend of your aunt Young Sook's cousin has a daughter.

75
00:07:46,290 --> 00:07:49,850
She is a doctor, and she's preety and kind.

76
00:07:49,850 --> 00:07:51,740
Enough.

77
00:07:51,740 --> 00:07:54,680
Why are you yelling at me?

78
00:07:54,680 --> 00:07:57,010
He's already given Yoo Jung the ring.

79
00:07:57,010 --> 00:07:59,640
Why do you keeping on introducing him to others?

80
00:08:00,550 --> 00:08:06,530
It's just a ring. They're not married, yet.

81
00:08:06,530 --> 00:08:08,620
Then you tell me.

82
00:08:08,620 --> 00:08:11,820
Who paid Do Hoon's tuition when we had no money?

83
00:08:11,820 --> 00:08:16,920
Who pay the moeny for ancestral services every year?

84
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:19,340
She bought him a car, and paid for his insurance

85
00:08:19,340 --> 00:08:21,630
When we almost lost this house because of your debt.

86
00:08:21,630 --> 00:08:24,870
Who helped us out to keep this house?

87
00:08:25,180 --> 00:08:28,820
I never asked her to do anything...

88
00:08:28,820 --> 00:08:30,520
Should I break up with her?

89
00:08:31,950 --> 00:08:34,650
Thank you for taking care of me.

90
00:08:34,650 --> 00:08:36,770
I'm a prosecutor now,

91
00:08:36,770 --> 00:08:39,580
and I'll marry someone with a better background.

92
00:08:39,580 --> 00:08:41,830
Is that what you want?

93
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:47,750
No, you can't do this.

94
00:08:48,150 --> 00:08:53,680
Mother. Don't turn me into a bad guy.

95
00:08:57,260 --> 00:09:01,810
Do Hoon! You should have breakfast!

96
00:09:01,810 --> 00:09:04,300
At least eat the egg.

97
00:09:04,300 --> 00:09:05,630
Come on.

98
00:09:13,020 --> 00:09:16,430
Prosecutor! My prosecutor son.

99
00:09:16,430 --> 00:09:17,880
Have a good day.

100
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:19,130
I love you.

101
00:09:19,130 --> 00:09:22,160
Stop! You'll bother others.

102
00:09:22,830 --> 00:09:26,410
Your Honor, take care.

103
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:53,180
Did you witness the accident?

104
00:09:53,180 --> 00:09:54,420
No.

105
00:09:54,420 --> 00:09:56,490
I didn't witness it.

106
00:09:56,490 --> 00:09:58,270
Wasn't there a surveillance camera?

107
00:09:58,270 --> 00:10:01,430
There were no surveillance cameras at the scene.

108
00:10:01,430 --> 00:10:04,180
There are cameras near the scene.

109
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:08,200
We're looking at the cars that entered the area,

110
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,720
but there are too many of them.

111
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,600
So you have the list of the cars, then?

112
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:14,960
We're still investigating that.

113
00:10:19,230 --> 00:10:21,270
Please help me.

114
00:10:23,450 --> 00:10:24,810
Wow!

115
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:28,640
Father!

116
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:30,230
Yoo Jung!

117
00:10:30,230 --> 00:10:32,230
Why do you come over here at this time?

118
00:10:32,230 --> 00:10:34,180
I work the afternoon shift.

119
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,220
Take this as a snack.

120
00:10:36,220 --> 00:10:37,630
I baked it this morning.

121
00:10:37,630 --> 00:10:40,010
Thank you.

122
00:10:40,010 --> 00:10:41,880
It's nothing.

123
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,640
By the way, where is the car key?

124
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:45,620
Here it is.

125
00:10:45,620 --> 00:10:47,530
What for?

126
00:10:49,030 --> 00:10:50,500
I'm going to get the car fixed.

127
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:53,210
There's something wrong with the wipers.

128
00:10:53,550 --> 00:10:55,150
Just ask Do Hoon to fix it.

129
00:10:55,150 --> 00:10:57,870
Today is his first day of work, he must be busy.

130
00:10:57,870 --> 00:11:00,120
I don't wnat to bother him.

131
00:11:00,870 --> 00:11:02,990
I'll see you later.

132
00:11:02,990 --> 00:11:04,480
Yoo Jung.

133
00:11:06,550 --> 00:11:09,100
Do Hoon told me.

134
00:11:10,330 --> 00:11:14,210
Thank you for making me your father-in-law.

135
00:11:21,380 --> 00:11:23,350
The wipers are broken.

136
00:11:23,350 --> 00:11:25,770
150000 KRW isn't enough.

137
00:11:25,770 --> 00:11:29,100
They'll charge you at least 500000KRW at a garage.

138
00:11:29,970 --> 00:11:32,660
That's why I came to you.

139
00:11:32,660 --> 00:11:35,770
You said you used to run a garage.

140
00:11:35,770 --> 00:11:37,400
You can fix it.

141
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:39,490
Even if I could get secondhand parts, it'd cost me over 150000 KRW.

142
00:11:39,490 --> 00:11:41,460
170000 KRW.

143
00:11:41,460 --> 00:11:43,520
No.

144
00:11:44,700 --> 00:11:46,390
I baked it myself.

145
00:11:46,390 --> 00:11:49,360
You said you like the bread I baked.

146
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,750
Come on. Ah.

147
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,770
Delicious.

148
00:12:00,650 --> 00:12:03,400
I checked the traffic cameras near the accident scene.

149
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:06,300
Get to the point. Have you found it?

150
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:10,430
I've narrowed it down to 3 cars.

151
00:12:21,990 --> 00:12:23,160
Who is she?

152
00:12:23,590 --> 00:12:26,000
You're still drunk.

153
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,100
You can't drive. Give me the keys.

154
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:34,300
Not only do you have no respect for money, but you have no respect for others, either.

155
00:12:34,300 --> 00:12:36,740
The customer is always right.

156
00:12:37,160 --> 00:12:39,110
You should listen to the customer.

157
00:12:41,250 --> 00:12:46,340
Ms. Seo Ji Hee's guardian please come to the ICU right away.

158
00:12:48,500 --> 00:12:49,900
No.

159
00:12:55,330 --> 00:12:56,360
Ji Hee.

160
00:12:58,220 --> 00:12:59,470
Wait.

161
00:13:00,470 --> 00:13:03,400
Are you okay?

162
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,870
What happend to her?

163
00:13:11,380 --> 00:13:15,590
Our baby.

164
00:13:25,630 --> 00:13:29,140
Ji Hee, it'll be okay.

165
00:13:32,590 --> 00:13:34,650
I love you.

166
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:38,100
What did you say?

167
00:13:38,100 --> 00:13:40,600
I love you.

168
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:49,010
Ji Hee!

169
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:57,250
Ji Hee! Open your eyes!

170
00:13:57,250 --> 00:14:04,670
Seo Ji Hee, 25 years old. Time of death, 3:57.

171
00:14:11,020 --> 00:14:14,120
I told you to save her.

172
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:17,820
I told you to save her. Bastard!

173
00:14:17,820 --> 00:14:22,620
Let go of me! I said let go.

174
00:14:57,730 --> 00:15:00,820
It's your first day. Don't work too hard.

175
00:15:03,220 --> 00:15:07,170
- I'm not working. - Aren't you tired of reading precedent cases?

176
00:15:08,040 --> 00:15:12,220
- It's not good to be too honest. Let's go. - Where are we going?

177
00:15:12,220 --> 00:15:15,200
We're having a welcome dinner for you.

178
00:15:16,910 --> 00:15:18,350
Have you finished the building?

179
00:15:18,350 --> 00:15:20,600
Yes. I stayed in Hong Kong to supervise it.

180
00:15:20,860 --> 00:15:24,220
A valuable building is even better than a person.

181
00:15:26,910 --> 00:15:32,110
- Se Yeon, are you back for good from France? - Yes.

182
00:15:32,110 --> 00:15:35,010
Are you really getting married?

183
00:15:35,010 --> 00:15:38,150
Marry? Your mother opened up an art gallery.

184
00:15:38,150 --> 00:15:40,160
I thought you come back to help her.

185
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:43,570
Jo Min Hyuk, right?

186
00:15:43,570 --> 00:15:45,340
Nothing's for sure yet.

187
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:47,410
Our parents are discussing the matter.

188
00:15:47,410 --> 00:15:51,550
Lots of celebrity girls come to Jo Min Hyuk's parties.

189
00:15:51,550 --> 00:15:55,720
I came across Hong Jung Ah ar the shopping mall, she regards herself as Min Hyuk's girlfriend.

190
00:15:56,070 --> 00:16:00,900
Hong Jung Ah? She's over the hill.

191
00:16:00,900 --> 00:16:03,410
No taste.

192
00:17:01,030 --> 00:17:03,090
Did you enjoy the show?

193
00:17:04,900 --> 00:17:08,930
I guess you're having a bad day as well.

194
00:17:47,210 --> 00:17:52,370
Thank you for coming.

195
00:17:54,270 --> 00:17:58,390
Are you an acquaintance of my daughter?

196
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:08,040
She's my friend.

197
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:48,240
What are you doing?

198
00:18:49,520 --> 00:18:52,150
- Is this your car? - Yes.

199
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:56,670
- Ms. Kang Yoo Jung? - Yes.

200
00:18:56,670 --> 00:19:00,600
Between 10 p.m. and 11 p.m. on the 23rd,

201
00:19:00,600 --> 00:19:03,670
were you on the No. 8 National Road?

202
00:19:04,420 --> 00:19:07,270
Were you driving yourself?

203
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:10,540
I seemed to hit something.

204
00:19:10,540 --> 00:19:15,260
I don't want to make things complicated. I just broke the bumper.

205
00:19:15,260 --> 00:19:19,910
I was driving. What's going on?

206
00:19:19,910 --> 00:19:24,370
- It's a hit-and-run case. - A hit-and-run? - Yes.

207
00:19:24,370 --> 00:19:27,020
What do you mean?

208
00:19:36,730 --> 00:19:40,560
The new musical will be held next month.

209
00:19:41,560 --> 00:19:45,190
I hope lots of people will come. That'll boost the morale of the performers.

210
00:19:47,430 --> 00:19:51,650
Arragnge some seats to congressmen.

211
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:58,050
Egg plant is good when it's hot. Have some.

212
00:20:09,100 --> 00:20:12,620
Min Hyuk, where were you the whole night?

213
00:20:14,540 --> 00:20:18,560
Ji Hee is dead.

214
00:20:19,790 --> 00:20:24,850
Steward, sprinkle some salt here.

215
00:20:24,850 --> 00:20:27,760
I don't want a ghost in my house.

216
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:34,690
I get it. Even though she's dead, I can't be with her?

217
00:20:37,470 --> 00:20:40,500
I like the way you look at me.

218
00:20:40,500 --> 00:20:44,020
If you lose something, you'll earn something.

219
00:20:44,020 --> 00:20:49,590
That's why I lost my mother, right?

220
00:20:52,370 --> 00:20:55,270
Min Hyuk, how can you talk to your father like that.

221
00:20:55,270 --> 00:20:57,430
Go to your room.

222
00:20:57,430 --> 00:20:59,780
Why don't you stay out of it?

223
00:20:59,780 --> 00:21:02,130
- This is our family matter. - Min Hyuk!

224
00:21:02,130 --> 00:21:06,170
Get out and leave us alone.

225
00:21:13,370 --> 00:21:19,040
When you were young, your puppy died, you cried for a while.

226
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:22,530
I bought you a car,

227
00:21:22,530 --> 00:21:26,220
and you forgot about the dog.

228
00:21:27,240 --> 00:21:29,750
How old are you?

229
00:21:29,750 --> 00:21:33,580
You're a little too old for crying over a toy.

230
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:35,730
What about you?

231
00:21:35,730 --> 00:21:38,160
You needed a new toy,

232
00:21:38,160 --> 00:21:40,470
so you live with her?

233
00:21:45,170 --> 00:21:49,880
Get out! Make your own money,

234
00:21:50,400 --> 00:21:54,000
and do whatever you want to do.

235
00:21:54,580 --> 00:21:59,330
You've never made a penny on your own.

236
00:22:00,700 --> 00:22:03,010
You want freedom?

237
00:22:03,010 --> 00:22:08,830
You'll realize that the freedom is given by me.

238
00:22:24,590 --> 00:22:28,070
- This is the case assigned to you. - Okay.

239
00:22:30,370 --> 00:22:33,000
Hello, prosecutor Ahn.

240
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:36,640
- Have you had lunch yet? - Yes.

241
00:22:37,450 --> 00:22:39,800
How do you feel about your first case?

242
00:22:39,800 --> 00:22:41,610
I'm nervous.

243
00:22:41,610 --> 00:22:46,250
Don't be nervous. The police will sue the defendant.

244
00:22:46,250 --> 00:22:48,420
The evidence is conclusive.

245
00:22:48,420 --> 00:22:50,660
- Just take it. - Okay.

246
00:22:50,660 --> 00:22:54,540
You're being too kind to him for his first case.

247
00:22:54,540 --> 00:22:57,030
It's so easy that he can definitely win.

248
00:22:57,030 --> 00:22:58,760
You always assign me difficult cases.

249
00:22:58,760 --> 00:23:00,720
Stop nagging.

250
00:23:00,720 --> 00:23:02,890
Let's go. Keep it up.

251
00:23:03,220 --> 00:23:06,330
Bye. About the case.

252
00:23:06,330 --> 00:23:10,070
- Have they arrested the culprit? - Not yet.

253
00:23:36,340 --> 00:23:38,420
It's a hit-and-run case.

254
00:23:38,420 --> 00:23:40,770
I'm not saying that you did it.

255
00:23:40,770 --> 00:23:45,340
We're investigating the cars that passed through the area at that time.

256
00:23:45,340 --> 00:23:47,890
Thank you for your cooperation.

257
00:23:49,030 --> 00:23:52,620
- Thank you. It'll be 7500KRW. - What are you doing?

258
00:23:52,620 --> 00:23:56,360
Sorry, drive safely.

259
00:23:58,570 --> 00:23:59,620
Dad.

260
00:23:59,620 --> 00:24:03,130
Yuejeong. There's a letter for you.

261
00:24:03,130 --> 00:24:05,310
What is it?

262
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:13,170
You're in the final list of the recipe contest.

263
00:24:13,170 --> 00:24:15,350
Really?

264
00:24:15,810 --> 00:24:19,570
We've got a lot of luck recently.

265
00:24:19,570 --> 00:24:21,190
Read it again, dad.

266
00:24:21,190 --> 00:24:26,020
You're in the final list of the recipe contest.

267
00:24:29,250 --> 00:24:31,050
I'm so happy!

268
00:24:44,370 --> 00:24:48,560
What are you doing here?

269
00:24:48,560 --> 00:24:51,880
I was thinking about going to your place.

270
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:53,990
What happened?

271
00:25:07,600 --> 00:25:09,510
Why didn't you tell me?

272
00:25:09,510 --> 00:25:12,370
You just became a prosecutor.

273
00:25:12,370 --> 00:25:14,740
I didn't want you to go to the police office.

274
00:25:14,740 --> 00:25:16,330
You idiot.

275
00:25:16,330 --> 00:25:18,290
Do you know how serious this case is?

276
00:25:18,290 --> 00:25:20,060
The police said I was a witness.

277
00:25:20,060 --> 00:25:21,760
They are investigating every car that passed that area.

278
00:25:21,760 --> 00:25:23,510
A witness?

279
00:25:23,510 --> 00:25:26,490
You're a main suspect in a hit-and-run case.

280
00:25:26,490 --> 00:25:30,240
The victim has dead.

281
00:25:31,810 --> 00:25:34,070
Dead?

282
00:25:34,470 --> 00:25:36,830
What is this?

283
00:25:36,830 --> 00:25:39,940
How come you're the driver here?

284
00:25:39,940 --> 00:25:44,370
I'm the owner of the car.

285
00:25:44,370 --> 00:25:45,450
So I said I drove the car that day.

286
00:25:45,450 --> 00:25:47,190
Why did you fix the car?

287
00:25:47,190 --> 00:25:49,740
I told you that I'd scrap it.

288
00:25:49,740 --> 00:25:50,700
I told you that I'd take care of it.

289
00:25:50,700 --> 00:25:53,400
Why did you do this?

290
00:25:55,170 --> 00:25:57,960
You should've told me first.

291
00:25:57,960 --> 00:25:59,730
I know how busy you are.

292
00:25:59,730 --> 00:26:02,690
I didn't want to bother you.

293
00:26:03,930 --> 00:26:07,590
You didn't even to go a garage.

294
00:26:07,590 --> 00:26:11,840
I wanted to save some money.

295
00:26:11,840 --> 00:26:13,680
I can explain everything.

296
00:26:13,680 --> 00:26:15,890
They don't need your explanation.

297
00:26:15,890 --> 00:26:18,630
They only believe what they see.

298
00:26:18,630 --> 00:26:21,590
It doesn't make sense. How can we be criminals?

299
00:26:21,590 --> 00:26:23,600
We were almost killed as well.

300
00:26:23,600 --> 00:26:25,900
The truck came out of nowhere,

301
00:26:25,900 --> 00:26:27,910
and we hit the truck.

302
00:26:30,480 --> 00:26:34,070
We're victims as well.

303
00:26:35,760 --> 00:26:40,990
That doesn't make us innocent.

304
00:26:46,950 --> 00:26:47,860
Do Hoon.

305
00:26:47,860 --> 00:26:49,220
Let's go tell them the truth.

306
00:26:49,220 --> 00:26:50,130
This is just ridiculous.

307
00:26:50,130 --> 00:26:52,780
Do Hoon, wait!

308
00:26:52,780 --> 00:26:54,580
Let's go.

309
00:26:54,580 --> 00:26:59,180
What's going to happen to you?

310
00:27:01,800 --> 00:27:05,400
I'm the prosecutor of this case.

311
00:27:13,780 --> 00:27:18,060
I'm not even allowed to see you under such circumstance.

312
00:27:18,740 --> 00:27:22,500
I'll probably have to resign.

313
00:27:23,550 --> 00:27:26,740
How could this happen?

314
00:27:48,220 --> 00:27:50,620
I'm not going.

315
00:27:52,430 --> 00:27:59,280
Do you remember the day we first met?

316
00:28:06,490 --> 00:28:10,240
Do you remember the words you said?

317
00:28:11,630 --> 00:28:13,390
Are you out of your mind?

318
00:28:13,390 --> 00:28:15,060
Hey, you.

319
00:28:15,060 --> 00:28:19,160
How can you put gasoline in a diesel car?

320
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:21,640
Didn't you see that?

321
00:28:21,640 --> 00:28:25,910
Here you go. Thank you. Come again.

322
00:28:26,900 --> 00:28:30,570
It's an expensive car. What are you going to do?

323
00:28:30,570 --> 00:28:34,590
I was about to put diesel, but you asked me to put petrol.

324
00:28:34,590 --> 00:28:37,240
I took a pity on you to let you work here.

325
00:28:37,240 --> 00:28:39,530
Now you're lying to me.

326
00:28:39,530 --> 00:28:42,680
I made a mistake, but I didn't lie.

327
00:28:42,680 --> 00:28:46,580
How dare you yell at me?

328
00:28:46,580 --> 00:28:50,030
You should apologize for your mistake.

329
00:28:50,030 --> 00:28:51,490
Sorry.

330
00:28:51,490 --> 00:28:53,010
What?

331
00:28:53,010 --> 00:28:55,170
I'm sorry.

332
00:28:55,170 --> 00:28:57,660
You should be sorry.

333
00:28:57,660 --> 00:28:59,750
What are you going to do with this?

334
00:28:59,750 --> 00:29:03,350
I'll deduct it from your salary every month.

335
00:29:03,350 --> 00:29:04,500
You can't do that.

336
00:29:04,500 --> 00:29:06,070
You know my situation.

337
00:29:06,070 --> 00:29:07,920
I don't care about your situation.

338
00:29:07,920 --> 00:29:09,480
I only care about my situation.

339
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:12,480
Accordign to the civil law, article 756,

340
00:29:13,550 --> 00:29:15,310
the person who hired an employee,

341
00:29:15,310 --> 00:29:17,320
is also responsible for paying

342
00:29:17,320 --> 00:29:19,140
the damage imposed on a 3rd party

343
00:29:19,140 --> 00:29:22,800
by his or her employee.

344
00:29:22,800 --> 00:29:27,520
To put it simply, the owner is responsible for the damage.

345
00:29:27,520 --> 00:29:34,280
There were cases that the owner pay for 20% of the damage.

346
00:29:34,740 --> 00:29:39,380
Who are you?

347
00:29:42,410 --> 00:29:45,950
I'm her boyfriend.

348
00:30:05,580 --> 00:30:12,650
Excuse me. Thank you for helping me.

349
00:30:13,600 --> 00:30:16,890
Why did you help me?

350
00:30:17,460 --> 00:30:19,690
Do I need to have a reason to help others?

351
00:30:19,690 --> 00:30:21,700
Why did you claim that you were my boyfriend?

352
00:30:21,700 --> 00:30:23,990
If I hadn't, he would've told me to go away.

353
00:30:23,990 --> 00:30:25,390
You could've told him that you were my brother.

354
00:30:25,390 --> 00:30:28,470
We don't look alike.

355
00:30:34,320 --> 00:30:36,150
We don't look alike.

356
00:30:36,150 --> 00:30:38,940
Have you ever lost in any argument?

357
00:30:38,940 --> 00:30:41,260
No.

358
00:30:41,260 --> 00:30:44,530
You'll win all your cases when you become a prosecutor.

359
00:30:44,530 --> 00:30:45,850
I hope so.

360
00:30:45,850 --> 00:30:48,480
Would you help me when I were wronged in the future?

361
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:50,850
I'll definitely help those who have no money and no power.

362
00:30:50,850 --> 00:30:52,580
What about those who have money and power?

363
00:30:52,580 --> 00:30:56,410
They'll be able to take care of themselves.

364
00:30:56,410 --> 00:31:00,970
What if you pretend that you don't know me?

365
00:31:07,420 --> 00:31:10,920
Take this to go for me.

366
00:31:10,920 --> 00:31:14,370
I'll help you.

367
00:31:38,550 --> 00:31:46,170
You told me to come to you with this when I'm in trouble.

368
00:31:49,870 --> 00:31:51,990
Help me.

369
00:31:51,990 --> 00:31:57,190
I was worried that my boyfriend would be wrongfully accused of being involved in a hit-and-run.

370
00:31:58,030 --> 00:32:00,740
So I said I was the driver.

371
00:32:00,740 --> 00:32:08,370
Please help my boyfriend.

372
00:32:08,370 --> 00:32:09,330
Yoo Jung.

373
00:32:09,330 --> 00:32:10,610
Will you help me?

374
00:32:10,610 --> 00:32:13,370
If you're prosecuted, you'll go to trial.

375
00:32:13,370 --> 00:32:15,080
Something terrible could happen.

376
00:32:15,080 --> 00:32:18,630
A hit-and-run driver would spend at least 5 years in prison.

377
00:32:18,630 --> 00:32:20,660
Do you know what that means?

378
00:32:20,660 --> 00:32:21,770
I trust you.

379
00:32:21,770 --> 00:32:24,070
But...

380
00:32:27,420 --> 00:32:29,740
You are so handsome.

381
00:32:33,040 --> 00:32:41,480
You're so handsome to achive your dream step by step.

382
00:32:44,780 --> 00:32:49,510
You've worked so hard to come this far.

383
00:32:52,960 --> 00:32:56,690
I know that more than anyone.

384
00:32:59,110 --> 00:33:01,990
You can't let all your efforts go waste due to a misunderstanding.

385
00:33:01,990 --> 00:33:03,340
What about your dreams?

386
00:33:03,340 --> 00:33:06,620
I need you to achieve my dreams.

387
00:33:06,620 --> 00:33:09,480
I can wait a little longer.

388
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:12,540
But...

389
00:33:14,560 --> 00:33:16,410
I love you.

390
00:33:16,410 --> 00:33:18,810
More than myself.

391
00:33:19,690 --> 00:33:21,890
I trust you.

392
00:33:21,890 --> 00:33:25,000
You can trust me, right?

393
00:33:25,710 --> 00:33:28,370
There must've been a mistake.

394
00:33:28,370 --> 00:33:32,510
We know the truth.

395
00:33:35,160 --> 00:33:39,060
You can protect me.

396
00:35:01,020 --> 00:35:04,930
Min Hyuk, what's your dream?

397
00:35:04,930 --> 00:35:08,080
Dream? I don't have one.

398
00:35:08,080 --> 00:35:09,800
Everybody has a dream.

399
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:12,700
You're too lazy to think about it.

400
00:35:12,700 --> 00:35:16,350
I'll take as much money as I can from my father,

401
00:35:16,800 --> 00:35:19,750
I want to live my life in my way.

402
00:35:21,600 --> 00:35:24,360
You're so bad.

403
00:35:26,720 --> 00:35:30,220
My father used to know how to smile.

404
00:35:30,220 --> 00:35:34,710
He's too rich, and now he's angry all the time.

405
00:35:34,710 --> 00:35:37,570
I should take his money for his own sake.

406
00:35:39,410 --> 00:35:43,330
What's your dream?

407
00:35:44,070 --> 00:35:49,030
To die just one day earlier than you.

408
00:35:49,030 --> 00:35:51,430
What?

409
00:35:52,330 --> 00:35:55,930
I want to hold your hand when we are old,

410
00:35:55,930 --> 00:35:59,630
go shopping and go to movies together,

411
00:35:59,630 --> 00:36:03,750
I can put my hand in your pocket when it's cold.

412
00:36:03,750 --> 00:36:10,220
When our grandchildren make a mess in our house, we can clean it up together.

413
00:36:10,220 --> 00:36:13,360
Our daughter would be beautiful

414
00:36:13,360 --> 00:36:15,710
if she looks like you.

415
00:36:15,710 --> 00:36:18,110
She would be adorable.

416
00:36:18,110 --> 00:36:19,480
That's easy.

417
00:36:19,480 --> 00:36:22,040
Really? Can you do that for me?

418
00:36:22,040 --> 00:36:24,040
Of course.

419
00:36:24,040 --> 00:36:27,360
It's not hard as long as we get old together.

420
00:36:54,340 --> 00:36:56,880
I was alomost dead.

421
00:37:48,590 --> 00:37:49,730
You're home so late.

422
00:38:14,430 --> 00:38:16,250
What do you think you're doing?

423
00:38:18,040 --> 00:38:20,150
You're prentending to be cool.

424
00:38:20,830 --> 00:38:22,330
What are you doing here?

425
00:38:22,340 --> 00:38:26,280
You're my only friend.

426
00:38:40,560 --> 00:38:42,310
What are these?

427
00:38:42,870 --> 00:38:44,450
I don't know.

428
00:38:49,880 --> 00:38:51,780
Why do you paint something

429
00:38:51,780 --> 00:38:52,780
that you don't know?

430
00:38:53,060 --> 00:38:56,120
I don't think about anything when I'm painting.

431
00:38:58,050 --> 00:38:59,390
That's good.

432
00:39:01,740 --> 00:39:03,290
Very good.

433
00:39:08,910 --> 00:39:10,660
How come?

434
00:39:11,410 --> 00:39:14,320
I don't even have a friend to turn to.

435
00:39:15,380 --> 00:39:18,300
What a pathetic life!

436
00:39:19,930 --> 00:39:22,040
I'm glad you've realized that now.

437
00:39:23,050 --> 00:39:25,240
Do you really want to marry me?

438
00:39:27,160 --> 00:39:28,770
If my father kicks me out,

439
00:39:28,770 --> 00:39:32,790
and I become penniless,

440
00:39:32,980 --> 00:39:35,420
will you marry me as well?

441
00:39:38,280 --> 00:39:40,330
Do you remember when we went to school?

442
00:39:41,430 --> 00:39:43,550
We wanted to play outside after school

443
00:39:43,560 --> 00:39:45,430
just like other kids.

444
00:39:45,440 --> 00:39:47,820
But there were reporters at the gate every day.

445
00:39:47,820 --> 00:39:49,880
We skipped a class and went outside to play once.

446
00:39:50,340 --> 00:39:53,040
Right, it was funny.

447
00:39:53,040 --> 00:39:57,780
But I never wanted to do it again.

448
00:39:59,660 --> 00:40:03,130
I suffered a lot to go home.

449
00:40:04,670 --> 00:40:08,330
I had no money to take a bus.

450
00:40:08,330 --> 00:40:11,550
My feet hurt so much after getting home.

451
00:40:11,550 --> 00:40:14,280
I swore that I would never do it again.

452
00:40:16,020 --> 00:40:19,060
If you were not the heir of K Corporation,

453
00:40:20,240 --> 00:40:21,750
I would not marry you.

454
00:40:21,770 --> 00:40:23,200
Typical Shin Se Yeon.

455
00:40:23,200 --> 00:40:24,650
It's your style.

456
00:40:29,230 --> 00:40:31,640
Don't you think that life sucks?

457
00:40:33,660 --> 00:40:35,540
It's so boring.

458
00:41:19,110 --> 00:41:22,100
Min Hyuk! Min Hyuk!

459
00:41:26,450 --> 00:41:28,700
Min Hyuk! Min Hyuk!

460
00:41:28,740 --> 00:41:30,910
What are you doing?

461
00:41:31,790 --> 00:41:34,750
Wake up!

462
00:41:34,750 --> 00:41:37,850
What's wrong with you? Min Hyuk!

463
00:41:38,220 --> 00:41:40,380
Wake up!

464
00:41:46,040 --> 00:41:49,210
He doesn't even dare to commit a suicide.

465
00:41:49,210 --> 00:41:51,090
So he took pills?

466
00:41:53,060 --> 00:41:55,630
He learns nothing good

467
00:41:56,800 --> 00:41:59,330
but it from his mother.

468
00:41:59,390 --> 00:42:02,530
I've kept this informaiton in secret.

469
00:42:05,820 --> 00:42:07,550
What about the media?

470
00:42:07,550 --> 00:42:11,070
I made an announcement that he's been working too hard.

471
00:42:11,070 --> 00:42:12,370
He was trying to commit a suicide.

472
00:42:12,370 --> 00:42:15,850
If being exposed to the media, it would've been a disaster.

473
00:42:15,850 --> 00:42:17,770
Se Yeon did a good job of dealing with the matter,

474
00:42:17,780 --> 00:42:20,180
So it won't be that terrible.

475
00:42:20,940 --> 00:42:23,500
He's my only son,

476
00:42:25,570 --> 00:42:27,870
and he's an idiot.

477
00:42:28,560 --> 00:42:30,000
Okay.

478
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:33,890
If he rests for a while, he'll be okay?

479
00:42:33,900 --> 00:42:35,440
Yes.

480
00:42:36,400 --> 00:42:37,940
By the way,

481
00:42:37,990 --> 00:42:39,360
what about the hit-and-run case?

482
00:42:39,360 --> 00:42:40,520
After checking the video,

483
00:42:40,530 --> 00:42:42,350
the police are going to issue an arrest warrant for the suspect.

484
00:42:42,350 --> 00:42:43,780
Really?

485
00:42:43,800 --> 00:42:44,730
Wrap it up quickly

486
00:42:44,740 --> 00:42:46,500
before the rumor gets out.

487
00:42:47,950 --> 00:42:50,300
There're too many things to worry about his marriage,

488
00:42:50,320 --> 00:42:53,060
I don't want to cause trouble due to that woman.

489
00:43:03,850 --> 00:43:06,960
Min Hyuk has had his stomach pumped.

490
00:43:06,970 --> 00:43:09,080
Luckily you found it quickly.

491
00:43:13,790 --> 00:43:16,200
You must be startled.

492
00:43:16,510 --> 00:43:20,110
No. I'm angry.

493
00:43:20,110 --> 00:43:24,710
Why can't you be honest with your feelings?

494
00:43:25,110 --> 00:43:28,660
You're a lot like Min Hyuk.

495
00:43:31,130 --> 00:43:34,210
Do you know that Ji Hee's dead?

496
00:43:34,920 --> 00:43:36,970
It was an accident.

497
00:43:36,980 --> 00:43:38,840
She was so young.

498
00:43:38,840 --> 00:43:41,240
Min Hyuk is so devastated.

499
00:43:47,400 --> 00:43:49,230
What a bastard.

500
00:43:49,760 --> 00:43:51,960
He came to die in front of me?

501
00:43:51,960 --> 00:43:53,760
How dare he!

502
00:43:55,770 --> 00:43:59,320
Se Yeon. If you like him,

503
00:43:59,320 --> 00:44:01,350
don't pretend that you're strong.

504
00:44:01,360 --> 00:44:04,190
It's easy to win a man's heart.

505
00:44:06,440 --> 00:44:09,120
When he feels vulnerable, stay with him.

506
00:44:09,670 --> 00:44:12,510
You should get rid of thorns when you buy roses.

507
00:44:12,510 --> 00:44:14,850
Maybe that's how you live,

508
00:44:15,520 --> 00:44:18,110
but I want to keep my dignity.

509
00:44:31,350 --> 00:44:35,600
Mom.

510
00:44:37,180 --> 00:44:38,880
Mom.

511
00:44:46,450 --> 00:44:49,980
Yes, I'm here. Are you okay?

512
00:44:50,690 --> 00:44:55,460
Get out of my room.

513
00:44:58,170 --> 00:45:00,840
I'll call your father.

514
00:45:14,240 --> 00:45:15,870
Hello.

515
00:45:16,910 --> 00:45:18,540
What?

516
00:45:20,210 --> 00:45:22,120
Are you sure?

517
00:45:26,480 --> 00:45:28,640
Min Hyuk, you haven't recoverd yet.

518
00:45:28,800 --> 00:45:29,870
Leave me alone.

519
00:45:29,870 --> 00:45:31,360
Then don't come to me.

520
00:45:31,660 --> 00:45:34,390
Don't behave like that in front of me because that woman.

521
00:45:34,440 --> 00:45:35,680
Leave me alone.

522
00:45:36,360 --> 00:45:37,840
Leave me alone.

523
00:45:40,750 --> 00:45:42,730
Pull yourself together.

524
00:45:42,730 --> 00:45:44,340
I saved your life,

525
00:45:44,350 --> 00:45:46,180
and you're trying to kill yourself again?

526
00:45:53,520 --> 00:45:55,600
I'm okay now.

527
00:45:55,870 --> 00:45:57,520
Thank you, Se Yeon.

528
00:45:58,310 --> 00:46:00,930
For saving my life.

529
00:46:04,880 --> 00:46:07,190
I just remembered what I have to do.

530
00:47:22,180 --> 00:47:26,090
Ms. Kang, do you really think that you're making any sense?

531
00:47:26,100 --> 00:47:28,210
I meant it. I didn't know.

532
00:47:28,220 --> 00:47:30,030
If you didn't know,

533
00:47:30,050 --> 00:47:33,440
why did you fix your car the next day

534
00:47:33,450 --> 00:47:35,850
at a place, which isn't even a garage?

535
00:47:35,850 --> 00:47:37,150
Don't you find it suspicious?

536
00:47:37,150 --> 00:47:38,460
Because,

537
00:47:39,230 --> 00:47:42,250
I want to get a discount from some one I know,

538
00:47:42,250 --> 00:47:43,610
A discount.

539
00:47:43,660 --> 00:47:45,160
We found blood,

540
00:47:45,160 --> 00:47:47,950
on the car you took to the guy you know

541
00:47:48,220 --> 00:47:49,710
for a discount.

542
00:47:49,710 --> 00:47:51,740
Impossible, there must be something wrong.

543
00:47:52,700 --> 00:47:53,780
Trust me.

544
00:47:53,780 --> 00:47:54,860
No one was there.

545
00:47:54,860 --> 00:47:56,440
I didn't see anybody.

546
00:47:56,580 --> 00:47:59,700
A truck just jumped out in front of us,

547
00:47:59,710 --> 00:48:00,940
and the car slipped,

548
00:48:00,940 --> 00:48:03,680
and we... I...

549
00:48:03,680 --> 00:48:05,890
I hit the drum

550
00:48:05,890 --> 00:48:09,200
in the construction site nearby.

551
00:48:09,240 --> 00:48:10,930
I got out of the car and checked myself.

552
00:48:10,930 --> 00:48:12,460
The drum you said

553
00:48:12,460 --> 00:48:14,600
wasn't at the scene of the accident.

554
00:48:14,600 --> 00:48:15,750
I moved it to the side

555
00:48:15,750 --> 00:48:17,490
so that no one else would get hurt.

556
00:48:17,490 --> 00:48:18,640
Please, go check one more time.

557
00:48:18,640 --> 00:48:21,010
I don't need to check.

558
00:48:21,120 --> 00:48:23,640
We have evidence.

559
00:48:23,790 --> 00:48:29,050
Do you think you can go away with it?

560
00:48:29,230 --> 00:48:33,210
Anyway, We'll get the result from forensic report on the blood today.

561
00:48:33,220 --> 00:48:35,460
No, this can't be true. I didn't know.

562
00:48:35,470 --> 00:48:38,010
I didn't see anyone.

563
00:48:38,650 --> 00:48:40,100
Oops!

564
00:48:53,650 --> 00:48:56,870
I don't think you understand how serious it is.

565
00:48:56,880 --> 00:48:59,200
The victim that you hit...

566
00:48:59,200 --> 00:49:00,360
Are you listening to me?

567
00:49:00,550 --> 00:49:02,570
Listen to me!

568
00:49:02,810 --> 00:49:05,860
I'm talking about the victim who died.

569
00:49:06,520 --> 00:49:09,270
Seo Ji Hee, 25 years old.

570
00:49:09,270 --> 00:49:12,360
She was found at the scene,

571
00:49:12,750 --> 00:49:15,770
and she was pregnant.

572
00:49:15,820 --> 00:49:19,450
We found the medical diagnosis she got that afternoon.

573
00:49:49,300 --> 00:49:51,170
Excuse me, where's the Traffic Accident Office?

574
00:49:51,500 --> 00:49:53,160
That way.

575
00:50:10,400 --> 00:50:11,550
Was that you?

576
00:50:13,040 --> 00:50:16,410
You can't just hit people and run away.

577
00:50:18,660 --> 00:50:19,720
Sorry.

578
00:50:21,160 --> 00:50:25,250
If you're really sorry, show me how sorry you are.

579
00:50:30,570 --> 00:50:31,780
Sorry.

580
00:50:34,030 --> 00:50:35,760
It seems like you are here for a cse.

581
00:50:36,910 --> 00:50:39,230
But I have no time to do this with you.

582
00:51:15,680 --> 00:51:19,680
How dare you hurt my woman?

583
00:51:47,240 --> 00:51:48,240
Hello.

584
00:51:48,240 --> 00:51:52,480
I have found the surveillance camera at the accident scene.

585
00:51:52,480 --> 00:51:54,340
I'll check now.

586
00:51:54,340 --> 00:51:58,210
No, I'll check myself. Please wait.

587
00:52:06,470 --> 00:52:08,630
Sorry can't deal with everything.

588
00:52:09,150 --> 00:52:10,900
You know how sad I am?

589
00:52:22,160 --> 00:52:23,160
Hey.

590
00:52:24,740 --> 00:52:25,680
What's this?

591
00:52:27,180 --> 00:52:30,610
What're you doing in the police office?

592
00:52:32,140 --> 00:52:34,080
Let go.

593
00:52:37,480 --> 00:52:40,360
What're you doing in the police office?

594
00:52:40,360 --> 00:52:42,070
Let her go.

595
00:52:43,050 --> 00:52:45,580
Who are you?

596
00:52:46,380 --> 00:52:49,660
Don't look at me with innocent eyes.

597
00:52:50,660 --> 00:52:51,800
Detective Choi.

598
00:53:09,490 --> 00:53:10,830
I'll see you tomorrow.

599
00:53:23,480 --> 00:53:24,610
Wait!

600
00:53:26,440 --> 00:53:29,720
The image isn't clear.

601
00:53:30,340 --> 00:53:32,710
It's impossible to see who the driver is.

602
00:53:32,710 --> 00:53:35,220
It took me a long time to find the license plate number.

603
00:53:36,260 --> 00:53:37,620
What's this car?

604
00:53:38,030 --> 00:53:39,850
If we find the black box from this car,

605
00:53:39,850 --> 00:53:43,720
we might be able to find the drum that the defendant saw.

606
00:53:43,720 --> 00:53:47,780
Sir, don't worry about the drum.

607
00:53:47,780 --> 00:53:50,580
If we have the driver's face on the black box,

608
00:53:50,580 --> 00:53:53,590
she won't be able to deny it any longer.

609
00:54:05,250 --> 00:54:08,930
I just collect them from the hospital.

610
00:54:09,990 --> 00:54:14,630
If the parents don't take them, the dead infant won't have a funeral.

611
00:54:14,700 --> 00:54:18,550
The surgery was done on the 24th at Sodam Hospital.

612
00:54:18,550 --> 00:54:20,400
I don't know.

613
00:54:21,770 --> 00:54:22,960
Well.

614
00:54:27,570 --> 00:54:29,260
Sodam Hospital.

615
00:55:48,890 --> 00:55:49,900
Kwang Soo!

616
00:55:51,130 --> 00:55:52,070
Yes.

617
00:55:52,430 --> 00:55:57,070
Why do all the people that I love leave me like this?

618
00:56:33,520 --> 00:56:35,180
What should I do?

619
00:56:38,560 --> 00:56:40,180
What should I do?

620
00:56:48,680 --> 00:56:54,770
Sorry. I'm so sorry.

621
00:56:59,820 --> 00:57:05,100
Does the law of our country allow a murder walk around freely?

622
00:57:07,720 --> 00:57:10,310
When did you start caring about the law?

623
00:57:11,080 --> 00:57:13,880
Why are you so interested in a stranger's case?

624
00:57:13,940 --> 00:57:15,620
She's not a stranger.

625
00:57:15,620 --> 00:57:17,090
Who? Kang Yoo Jung?

626
00:57:17,090 --> 00:57:18,780
What do you think will happen?

627
00:57:19,070 --> 00:57:22,200
Rain erased most of the evidence,

628
00:57:22,750 --> 00:57:26,790
but we found footsteps walking away from the victim,

629
00:57:28,350 --> 00:57:31,560
they're hard to identify.

630
00:57:32,370 --> 00:57:37,310
We could use it as proof that she left the victim there on purpose.

631
00:57:39,160 --> 00:57:43,680
She saw the victim, yet she walked away.

632
00:57:49,920 --> 00:57:51,880
Are you busy this afternoon?

633
00:57:53,540 --> 00:57:54,470
What?

634
00:57:54,630 --> 00:57:56,260
I need to ask you a favor.

635
00:57:58,600 --> 00:58:01,330
I have a friend.

636
00:58:02,330 --> 00:58:04,660
He's a complete jackass,

637
00:58:05,020 --> 00:58:07,690
but I want to get along well with him.

638
00:58:09,430 --> 00:58:12,240
He wants to see you.

639
00:58:12,240 --> 00:58:13,490
Me?

640
00:58:13,490 --> 00:58:16,430
I think he knows the victim in your case.

641
00:58:16,430 --> 00:58:19,380
He wants to know a few things regarding the case.

642
00:58:20,480 --> 00:58:24,350
He must be a very powerful man to pull strings like this.

643
00:58:25,040 --> 00:58:29,100
He's the heir of the K Corporation.

644
00:58:30,570 --> 00:58:32,920
The car is waiting outside.

645
00:58:33,580 --> 00:58:38,460
I know it's awkward to ask you this.

646
00:58:43,260 --> 00:58:46,300
You don't have to if you don't want to.

647
00:58:47,650 --> 00:58:49,160
I'll go.

648
00:58:49,940 --> 00:58:52,860
I'm curious what he wants to know.

649
00:58:53,950 --> 00:58:55,260
Thank you.

650
00:58:58,080 --> 00:58:59,610
Prosecutor Ahn,

651
00:59:01,710 --> 00:59:03,180
I'll escort you.

652
00:59:27,530 --> 00:59:29,370
Please wait here for a moment.

653
01:00:20,370 --> 01:00:22,890
Have we ever met before?

654
01:00:25,390 --> 01:00:26,480
Yes.

655
01:00:26,540 --> 01:00:27,560
Attack.

656
01:00:46,440 --> 01:00:50,920
He doesn't understand Korean. He was trained in Germany.

657
01:00:55,590 --> 01:00:57,470
I hope you don't remember me.

658
01:00:59,980 --> 01:01:01,220
Let's go.

659
01:01:14,750 --> 01:01:17,590
You're a little different from Hyun Suk.

660
01:01:21,500 --> 01:01:22,980
Have a seat.

661
01:01:27,460 --> 01:01:28,570
Siblings?

662
01:01:29,180 --> 01:01:30,300
No.

663
01:01:30,840 --> 01:01:31,890
Are you married?

664
01:01:32,260 --> 01:01:33,710
Not yet.

665
01:01:35,320 --> 01:01:37,820
You seem bored. Do you have a girlfriend?

666
01:01:38,510 --> 01:01:39,930
Is this a job interview?

667
01:01:44,680 --> 01:01:46,960
This is Ahn Do Hoon, a prosecutor from the Seoul District Court.

668
01:01:49,050 --> 01:01:50,180
Good to see you again.

669
01:01:56,450 --> 01:01:59,880
She's my fiancee Shin Se Yeon.

670
01:02:05,480 --> 01:02:08,480
I heard that you're interested in my case.

671
01:02:09,030 --> 01:02:11,380
Okay, let's get to the point.

672
01:02:13,320 --> 01:02:17,430
How many years can she get in this case?

673
01:02:18,430 --> 01:02:21,070
That's not the reason why you wanted to see me.

674
01:02:21,140 --> 01:02:23,090
I like the way you talk.

675
01:02:23,910 --> 01:02:27,670
I heard that you have sufficient evidence for your case.

676
01:02:28,660 --> 01:02:31,850
Why haven't you prosecuted the defendant yet?

677
01:02:33,720 --> 01:02:36,410
It's an ongoing investigation, and we can't discuss it.

678
01:02:37,550 --> 01:02:40,130
Really? Keep investigating.

679
01:02:40,200 --> 01:02:43,540
Kang Yoo Jung. Make her suffer.

680
01:02:50,880 --> 01:02:53,920
Can I ask you how you know Kang Yoo Jung?

681
01:02:55,280 --> 01:02:57,720
I don't care who she is.

682
01:02:59,550 --> 01:03:00,410
I care about the victim.

683
01:03:00,410 --> 01:03:01,870
Seo Ji Hee.

684
01:03:03,020 --> 01:03:05,500
She is the woman he loves most.

685
01:03:06,500 --> 01:03:08,940
You must know because you're the prosecutor.

686
01:03:10,420 --> 01:03:12,300
The victim...

687
01:03:15,720 --> 01:03:17,640
I heard that she was pregnant.

688
01:03:22,010 --> 01:03:26,430
Se Yeon, your mother's coming tonight. Stop drinking.

689
01:03:33,680 --> 01:03:34,800
I have to go.

690
01:03:36,370 --> 01:03:38,850
I haven't done my hair yet to take you here.

691
01:03:39,660 --> 01:03:42,080
My mother will give me an earful.

692
01:03:42,220 --> 01:03:45,100
Wait. I'll call a driver for you.

693
01:03:45,100 --> 01:03:50,330
That's okay. Stop being nice. It's not like you.

694
01:03:52,540 --> 01:03:55,880
Tell him about the girl that you loved so much.

695
01:04:07,600 --> 01:04:11,370
I can't do you a favor simply because you asked me to.

696
01:04:12,040 --> 01:04:13,420
I didn't ask you.

697
01:04:16,560 --> 01:04:21,560
I want to see if you are a qualified prosecutor.

698
01:04:54,710 --> 01:04:56,250
I'll drive.

699
01:04:56,940 --> 01:04:57,990
Go away.

700
01:04:59,260 --> 01:05:00,950
You had four glasses of wine.

701
01:05:01,750 --> 01:05:03,840
Leave me alone.

702
01:05:06,510 --> 01:05:07,960
I am worried about you.

703
01:05:31,810 --> 01:05:32,800
Kwang Soo.

704
01:05:35,120 --> 01:05:36,120
Yes.

705
01:05:36,790 --> 01:05:40,930
Do a background check on him.

706
01:05:41,910 --> 01:05:42,950
Yes.

707
01:05:51,060 --> 01:06:04,080
Next on Secret Love.

708
01:06:05,850 --> 01:06:07,070
Take it easy.

709
01:06:07,070 --> 01:06:08,700
Let's talk over drink.

710
01:06:08,940 --> 01:06:10,240
Let's be friends.

711
01:06:10,840 --> 01:06:14,090
Ms. Kang Yoo Jung, you're under arrest.

712
01:06:15,230 --> 01:06:20,620
I sentence Kang Yoo Jung to jail for 5 years.

713
01:06:20,620 --> 01:06:25,490
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight.

714
01:06:25,930 --> 01:06:28,740
You don't even know that you're pregnant.

715
01:06:28,740 --> 01:06:31,840
Kang Yoo Jung is pregnant?

716
01:06:32,700 --> 01:06:34,230
This is getting interesting.
